t. after noun 1Kin 7:27 , 43 +? Josh 15:57 ; 21:5 , 26 (all P), 1Chr 6:46 ; 2Chr 4:7 ; before בָּאַמָּה = ten cubits 1Kin 6:3 , 25 , 26 ; 7:23-24 ,. b. עֲשָׂרָה before masculine plural noun, Gen 45:23 25 t. (including ׳ע אֲלָפִים = 10, 000 2Sam 18:3 ; 2Kin 24:14 Kt, עֲשֶׂרֶת Qr); before n.collective בָּקָר 1Kin 5:3 , רֶכֶב 2Kin 13:7 ; also ׳ע הַוֶּה לֶחֶם 1Sam 17:17 these ten loaves , compare 1Kin 14:3 ; ׳ע אֶלֶף Ezek 45:1 read ᵐ5 א ׳עֶשְׂרִיס Hi Co Berthol Toy; after masculine plural noun Gen 32:16 (twice in verse); 43:3 (all E), Josh 17:5 (JE), Num 29:23 (P), 1Kin 7:43 ; 2Chr 4:6 , 8 ; Dan 1:12 , 14 , 15 ; after n.collective צאֹן 2Chr 30:24 ; noun omitted, that is men , Gen 18:32 (J) Amos 5:3 ; Ezra 8:4 ; that is shekels (weight) Gen 24:22 (J) Num 7:14 13 t. Numbers 7 ( ׳ע זָהָב ); ׳ע כֶסֶף (that is shekels , value) 2Sam 18:11 ; that is measures (of grain) Hag 2:16 ; with article the ten Gen 18:23 (J; that is men ), Neh 11:1 ( id. = every ten ); as predicate Exod 27:12 (twice in verse) = 38:12 (twice in verse) (all P) . c. עֲשֶׂ֫רֶת before masculine plural noun Exod 34:28 18 t., + הַיָּמִים כַּעֲשֶׂרֶת 1Sam 25:38 (on article compare Weir in Dr, but dubious; probably omitted, so ᵐ5 We Bu), + ׳ע אֲלָפִים = 10, 000 Judg 1:4 26 t.; noun omitted ׳ע כֶּסֶף (that is shekels ) 17:10 . 3 rarely + other number: a. עֶשֶׂר after larger number, ׳וָע שָׁנִים מֵאָה Gen 50:22 , 26 ; Josh 24:29 (all E), Judg 2:8 . b. ׳ע before larger number שָׁנָה מֵאוֺת וּתְשַׁע שָׁנִים עֶשֶׂר Gen 5:14 (P). c. עֲשָׂרָה after larger number, הַזְּכָרִים וַעֲשָׂרָה מֵאָה Ezra 8:12 , compare (noun preceding) 1:10 . d. עֲשָׂרָה after smaller number, הַכָּ֑סֶף וַעֲשָׂרָה שְׁקָלִים שִׁבְעָה Jer 32:9 = seventeen shekels ; before smaller number + singular noun שֶׁקֶל וַחֲמִשָּׁה עֲשָׂרָה Ezek 45:12 , but read חֲמִשִּׁים joining עֲשָׂרָה to preceding, ᵐ5 A Hi Co and others","rootNote":"masculine of term עֲשָׂרָה ; from 6237 ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"